    "name": "Gattai TD",
    "steam_appid": 3324380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324380/extras/649dc3309ccd8cdda0ddfea685011e2c.poster.avif?t=1749096498\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324380/extras/649dc3309ccd8cdda0ddfea685011e2c.webm?t=1749096498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324380/extras/649dc3309ccd8cdda0ddfea685011e2c.mp4?t=1749096498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love note to old mazing TDs, Gattai TD forces you to adapt how and what you build each time you play. Start with a small defense that you must grow into a larger more powerful one.\u00a0Each playthrough is a new experience with unique challenges. No single strategy will win every time\u2014you must react wisely to what you are dealt in order to succeed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine colors to form towers!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create towers by combining colored essence in different ways. Plan what towers you choose to merge them into, as different towers excel with different pathing layouts.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine towers to form stronger towers!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine towers together with other towers to form unique, more powerful variants. However, be careful, as the more powerful a tower is the more pivotal its position in your defense!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match your towers to\u00a0items of power!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain items that boost individual towers or your entire defense. These relics can result in powerful synergies or wasted potential.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324380/extras/649dc3309ccd8cdda0ddfea685011e2c.poster.avif?t=1749096498\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324380/extras/649dc3309ccd8cdda0ddfea685011e2c.webm?t=1749096498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324380/extras/649dc3309ccd8cdda0ddfea685011e2c.mp4?t=1749096498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love note to old mazing TDs, Gattai TD forces you to adapt how and what you build each time you play. Start with a small defense that you must grow into a larger more powerful one.\u00a0Each playthrough is a new experience with unique challenges. No single strategy will win every time\u2014you must react wisely to what you are dealt in order to succeed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine colors to form towers!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create towers by combining colored essence in different ways. Plan what towers you choose to merge them into, as different towers excel with different pathing layouts.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine towers to form stronger towers!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine towers together with other towers to form unique, more powerful variants. However, be careful, as the more powerful a tower is the more pivotal its position in your defense!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match your towers to\u00a0items of power!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain items that boost individual towers or your entire defense. These relics can result in powerful synergies or wasted potential.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Gattai TD is a roguelike, mazing tower defense in which you merge towers and gain ancient wonders to hold back waves of cursed keepsakes.",
